* Speak to {n:Balasiel} to start the quest.
* Proceed to {z:Ordelle's Caves} at {z:map 2|Ordelle's Caves} (G-7).
** The fastest route here is to use the {p:Proto-Waypoint} warp to {z:La Theine Plateau}. Turn around to enter {z:Ordelle's Caves}, then travel north until you reach the map.
** An alternative route is to go to {z:La Theine Plateau} (H-7), and enter {z:Ordelle's Caves}.
