*** Take the southwest passage (to Point C, G/H-6) which leads you to map 2. On map 2, proceed to the large room at (G-7).
* Examine the **???** in the pool of water, which will read "You place your hands into the pool." Quickly move towards the middle of the room and examine the **???** for the {@k} {k:Stalactite dew}.
** If you do not check the second ??? quickly enough, you will have to try again.
* Speak to Balasiel to complete the quest.

